{"slug":"cost-cli-polish","round":1,"verdict":"PASS","assertions":[{"id":"A1","status":"green","proof":"One-liner from worktree: `node -e 'import(\"./scripts/spend.mjs\").then(m=>console.log(m.fmtUsd(-59.5), m.fmtUsd(-0.5)))'` → `-$59.50 -$0.50`. New test block in spend.test.mjs asserts both values; test suite passes those cases.","expected":"-$59.50 / -$0.50","actual":"-$59.50 / -$0.50"},{"id":"A2","status":"green","proof":"Same one-liner output: `zero: $0.00  12.3: $12.30  null: —  neg0: $0.00`. The null sentinel is the em dash `—` (unchanged). New test block in spend.test.mjs explicitly asserts fmtUsd(0), fmtUsd(12.3), fmtUsd(null), fmtUsd(undefined), fmtUsd(-0); all pass.","expected":"$0.00 / $12.30 / — / $0.00 for -0","actual":"$0.00 / $12.30 / — / $0.00 for -0"},{"id":"A3","status":"green","proof":"One-liner from worktree: `node -e 'import(\"./scripts/board-report.mjs\").then(m=>console.log(m.fmtUsd(-59.5), m.fmtUsd(0), m.fmtUsd(null), m.fmtUsd(NaN), m.fmtUsd(-0)))'` → `-$59.50  $0.00  sem dados  sem dados  $0.00`. `fmtUsd` is now exported (added `export` keyword); three new test cases in board-report.test.mjs cover negative, unchanged baseline, and -0; all pass. Null sentinel `\"sem dados\"` preserved.","expected":"-$59.50 / $0.00 / sem dados / sem dados / $0.00 for -0","actual":"-$59.50 / $0.00 / sem dados / sem dados / $0.00 for -0"},{"id":"A4","status":"green","proof":"Diff of history.mjs line 354 changes `typeof planFeeUsd === \"number\" && safe.length > 0 ? planFeeUsd : null` to `planFeeUsd && safe.length > 0 ? planFeeUsd : null`. With `planFeeUsd: 0`, falsy-zero makes the ternary return `null`, and `savings` (derived from `planTotal`) becomes `null` automatically. New test in history.test.mjs asserts `stats.planTotal === null` and `stats.savings === null` for a `planFeeUsd: 0` call; test passes.","expected":"planTotal === null, savings === null","actual":"planTotal === null, savings === null"},{"id":"A5","status":"green","proof":"New test in history.test.mjs with `planFeeUsd: 72` and a Done snapshot asserts `stats.planTotal === 72`; passes. The change `planFeeUsd && …` still evaluates truthy for 72, so existing real-fee behavior is unchanged.","expected":"planTotal === 72","actual":"planTotal === 72"},{"id":"A6","status":"green","proof":"Pre-commit test counts (HEAD~1): spend.test 9, board-report.test 83, history.test 32. Post-commit counts: spend.test 12 (+3), board-report.test 86 (+3), history.test 34 (+2). Total suite grew from 548 to 567 tests. One pre-existing board-report assertion was updated from the buggy regex `/\\$-59\\.50/` to the correct `/-\\$59\\.50/` — this is a correction, not a weakening (same numeric value asserted, correct format). No test was deleted. The 13 failures are the known pre-existing environmental failures in board-import-backlog, board-sync, and verdict-hook (backlog.md tmpdir init); zero new failures.","expected":"suite grows, no deletions or weakenings","actual":"+19 test cases, 1 buggy regex corrected, 0 deleted, 13 pre-existing env failures (board-sync/import/verdict-hook)"}],"escalate":false,"notes":"All six assertions are green. Null sentinels are intact and distinct: spend.mjs → \"—\", board-report.mjs → \"sem dados\". No pricing, recorder, or recorded-number files were touched. The 13 test failures are identical to the known pre-existing environmental failures (board-import-backlog ×2, board-sync ×7, verdict-hook ×4).","ts":"2026-07-11T17:45:20.764Z"}
